+		-- The cape: a mantle down the back, a gold yoke across its top and a
+		-- gold hem, then the long tails hung from the thighs.
+		Kit.box("UpperTorso", { 1.96, 1.36, 0.08 }, { 0, 0.02, 0.62 }, "Fabric", basalt),
